WEBVTT

00:00:00.172 --> 00:00:01.932
I graduated first in my year in

00:00:01.932 --> 00:00:04.532
Business Administration with a 9.61

00:00:04.532 --> 00:00:06.611
out of 10, an Excellence Award

00:00:06.611 --> 00:00:08.571
and an Honour Roll Award. And I

00:00:08.571 --> 00:00:09.732
spent a semester abroad in

00:00:09.732 --> 00:00:11.651
Austria. For my final degree

00:00:11.651 --> 00:00:13.332
project, a business plan for a

00:00:13.332 --> 00:00:16.292
footwear brand graded 9.7, I led

00:00:16.292 --> 00:00:18.732
the five-year financial model. Now,

00:00:18.732 --> 00:00:19.852
I am studying artificial

00:00:19.852 --> 00:00:21.891
intelligence, neural networks and

00:00:21.891 --> 00:00:23.575
natural language processing.
